                    sum_r1_weak:            `Mistook a position for an interest, or mis-aimed control.`,
                    sum_r2_good:            `Control via reserved matters + IP ring-fenced, not transferred.`,
                    sum_r2_weak:            `Chased equity or governance that does not confer real control.`,
